1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,000
字幕制作：测试样本组

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,200
你今天怎么这么早就起来了
Why are you up so early today?

3
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:09,000
我睡不着 干脆起来煮点咖啡
I couldn't sleep,
so I figured I'd make some coffee.

4
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:12,800
你要不要也来一杯 我煮了一大壶
够我们两个人喝一整个上午
Do you want a cup too? I made a big pot,
enough for both of us to drink all morning.

5
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,000
好啊 - 加不加糖
- Sure. - Sugar?

6
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:17,500
{\an8}（水壶鸣响）

7
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:17,600
{\an8}[kettle whistling]

8
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,500
楼下那家店的新iPhone壳打八折
我昨天顺手买了一个
The shop downstairs has phone cases
at 20% off, so I grabbed one yesterday.

9
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,000
一共是128.50元
比网上便宜了差不多30块
It came to 128.50 in total,
about 30 cheaper than online.

10
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:29,000
说明书上写着去
https://example.com/help/setup?step=2 下载App
The manual says to go
to https://example.com/help/setup?step=2 and get the app.

11
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:31,000
营业时间 9:00-21:00

12
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:31,100
{\an8}OPEN 9 AM - 9 PM

13
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:35,000
其实我一直想跟你说 下个月我
可能要搬到离公司近一点的地方去住
I might move closer to work next month.

14
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:33,200
There's something I've
been meaning to tell you.

15
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:37,000
真的吗
Really?

16
00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:40,000
嗯 每天通勤两个小时 实在是太累了
Yeah. Two hours of commuting
every day is just too much.

17
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:43,500
<i>♪ 窗外的雨一直下 ♪
♪ The rain keeps falling outside ♪</i>

18
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:47,800
那周末我帮你一起看房子吧
顺便去吃那家我们一直说要去的面馆
Then let me help you look at places this weekend,
and we can finally try that noodle place we keep talking about.

19
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,000
好 就这么说定了！
Deal!

20
00:00:50,500 --> 00:00:51,500
{\an8}[door closes]

21
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:54,000
她走了以后，房间突然安静了下来。

22
00:00:54,500 --> 00:00:57,000
喂？我在家 你到楼下了吗
Hello? I'm home. Are you downstairs?

23
00:00:57,100 --> 00:00:58,500
我马上下来
I'll come down.
